  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e172222473575b83955eed855b2cc8ffe1219b47\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"495\" height=\"330\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e172222473575b83955eed855b2cc8ffe1219b47\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"800\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30cf8cdbf265db749dacc7b84553a9d6d58cf72c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"356\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30cf8cdbf265db749dacc7b84553a9d6d58cf72c\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"542\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>부분 월식은 개기월식이 진행되는 과정에서 거쳐가는 단계인가요?&#160;<br>저는 아래 그림에서 B는 개기월식이고 C의 경우가 부분월식이라고 생각했습니다.<br>다니면 두 경우를 모두 부분 월식이라고 하는 것인가요?&#160;<br>무지한 비전공자를 도와주시기 바랍니다 ㅎㅎㅎ </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02cebd71e063585d92ec629d66fdfd2b0e216c05\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"477\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02cebd71e063585d92ec629d66fdfd2b0e216c05\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"800\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
